7. The findings of this Court on the above points are as under :
 Point No.1 : In the Affirmative;
 Point No.2 : In the Partly Affirmative;
 Point No.3 : As per final order for the  following:
 REASONS  8. Point No.1 : It is specific case of the petitioner that, petitioner being legally wedded wife of respondent No.1 has been subjected to cruelty and domestic violence by the respondents.

